6791","tmdb_id":286791,"content_type":"animation","title":"Digimon Beatbreak","title_en":null,"title_fr":null,"original_title":null,"tagline":null,"description":"تنقلب حياة تومورو تينما رأسا على عقب حين يظهر جيكومون من جهاز الذكاء الاصطناعي الخاص به، ليقحمه في مغامرة تربط بين البشر والوحوش الرقمية وفريق غامض من صائدي الجوائز.","description_en":"Tomoro Tenma lives in a world where human thoughts and emotions, known as e-Pulse, power AI devices called Sapotama. But when Digimon begin materializing from Sapotama and feeding on e-Pulse, society begins to fracture. After Gekkomon appears from his device, Tomoro joins Glowing Dawn, a secret team investigating rogue Digimon and the dark truth of a system both fueled and corrupted by emotion.","description_fr":"Tomoro Tenma vit dans un monde où les pensées et les émotions humaines (appelées “e-Pulse“) alimentent des appareils IA, les Sapotama. Mais lorsque des Digimon commencent à se matérialiser à partir des Sapotama et à se nourrir d'e-Pulse, le monde est en danger. Après l'apparition de Gekkomon depuis son appareil, Tomoro rejoint Glowing Dawn, une équipe enquêtant sur les Digimon rebelles.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bdKO0jm7Bwp6ft2JEg7DiVHCON3.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7Sz41DFZZpnkbLVJFKSF1cbCMyz.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":7.6,"vote_count":21,"age_rating":"TV-Y7","year":"2025","release_date":"2025-10-05","runtime_minutes":24,"status":"Ended","country":"اليابان","language":"اليابانية","genres":["رسوم متحركة","حركة ومغامرة","خيال علمي وفانتازيا","أطفال","أنمي الخيال العلمي","الرسوم المتحركة اليابانية","أنمي المغامرات"],"genre_keys":["animation","action","scifi","kids","adventure"],"similar":["tv15260","tv51817","tv4686","tv62211","tv232322","tv65930","tv57706","tv73223"],"director":null,"cast":[{"name":"入野自由","character":"Tomoro Tenma (voice)","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8qEEhHUObNvGQr4e6eqLu5z4qTz.jpg"},{"name":"ميغومي هان","character":"Gekkomon (voice)","p